  "description": "Sqrt(x) (LeetCode 69) explained: binary search on the answer for the last r with r*r <= x, why mid rounds up, the 32-bit overflow trap, integer Newton as the follow-up, a dry run on x = 50 and tested code.",
  "hero": {
