      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search on the answer</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Math</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/sqrtx/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 69</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Sqrt(x)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The test \"r·r &lt;= x\" is yes for every r up to the root and no after it, so binary search for the last yes. Round mid up when the \"yes\" branch keeps mid, and square in 64 bits (or compare mid &lt;= x / mid). O(log x) time, O(1) space; integer Newton is the faster follow-up.</p>\n"
  },
